Every permitted distribution must preserve applicable copyright, license and attribution notices and provide recipients with this license, TRADEMARKS.md, NOTICE.md, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the applicable license texts and third-party notices. These obligations apply to source and compiled distributions, including packages, container images, installed Skills and embedded copies.

Modified distributions must clearly identify material changes and their independent origin. Do not represent a modified build or fork as an official WOS distribution.

You may not remove or obscure applicable legal notices or represent that material covered exclusively by this license is under unrestricted replacement terms. Your own independent code retains its own applicable terms; distributing it alongside Software does not relicense Licensor's material or require publishing that independent code.

